SUMMARY:Deadline: Ubah Rumah Residency 2027/2028 (Nikoi Island\, Indonesia\
 ; Southeast Asian artists)
DESCRIPTION:A residency on Nikoi Island focused on art\, ecology and hospit
 ality. ELIGIBILITY: artists from or based in Southeast Asia. OFFER: an art
 ist fee (amount not published)\, accommodation and a round trip within Sou
 theast Asia\, for a stay of four to six weeks in 2027 or 2028. APPLY by Go
 ogle Form\; only shortlisted artists are contacted. DEADLINE: 30 November 
 2026.\n\nOrganisation: Ubah Rumah\nLocation: Nikoi Island\, Bintan\, Indon
 esia. Artists from or based in Southeast Asia.\nAward: Artist fee (figure 
 not published)\, accommodation and a round trip within Southeast Asia.\nDu
 ration: 4 to 6 weeks in 2027 or 2028\n\nMore: https://www.ubahrumah.com/ub
 ah-rumah-residency/ubah-rumah-residency-open-call?utm_source=artificialnou
 veaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
