SUMMARY:Deadline 17:00 Tokyo time: Sado Island Galaxy Art Festival 2027: Op
 en Call (Japan\; production grant up to about JPY 2\,000\,000)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 22 Dec 2026 at 17:00 Tokyo time.\n\nAbout 4 to 5 site-sp
 ecific projects are selected for an 85-day island art festival on Sado. Th
 ere are six categories\, including one for advanced technology integration
 \, and proposals should engage the island's history\, ecology\, climate an
 d marine issues. ELIGIBILITY: all nationalities\, age 18 and over\; indivi
 duals and groups.\n\nOrganisation: Sado International Art Promotion Organi
 zation\nLocation: Sado Island\, Niigata\, Japan. Festival 17 July to 7 Nov
 ember 2027.\nAward: Production grant of up to about JPY 2\,000\,000 per pr
 oject\, with artist fees itemised in the budget. JPY 1\,500 application fe
 e per proposal.\nDuration: 85-day festival\, 17 July to 7 November 2027\n\
 nMore: https://sado-art.com/en/news/4499/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugran
 tdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://sado-art.com/en/news/4499/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdes
 k&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Sado Island\, Niigata\, Japan. Festival 17 July to 7 November 2027
 .
END:VEVENT
